cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "renew-glm: Streaming generalized linear models with bounded memory"
abstract: >-
  renew-glm fits generalized linear models on datasets larger than RAM using the
  renewable estimation of Luo and Song (2020). One pass per iteration accumulates
  the sufficient statistics, so peak memory scales with the number of covariates
  rather than the number of observations. It supports the gaussian, binomial and
  Poisson families, and its estimates are checked against statsmodels in the test
  suite.
